s picked up on a hot mic).\n\nPostponement:\nIf the event is postponed, and such a postponement is announced by the end of the following calendar day to be rescheduled to a time within 14 calendar days, the markets shall remain open.","settlement_bounds_type":"default","settlement_timer_seconds":1800,"settlement_ts":"2026-03-27T18:03:07.870827Z","settlement_value_dollars":"1.0000","status":"finalized","strike_type":"custom","ticker":"KXGOVERNORMENTION-26MAR27-BORD","title":"What will Greg Abbott say during CPAC: Welcome to Texas?","updated_time":"2026-03-27T18:03:07.928607Z","volume_24h_fp":"0.00","volume_fp":"2560.00","yes_ask_dollars":"1.0000","yes_ask_size_fp":"0.00","yes_bid_dollars":"0.0000","yes_bid_size_fp":"0.00","yes_sub_title":"Border"},{"can_close_early":true,"close_time":"2026-02-26T01:28:33Z","created_time":"2026-02-25T20:41:12.602842Z","custom_strike":{"Word":"Trump"},"early_close_condition":"This market will close and expire early if the event occurs.","event_ticker":"KXGOVERNORMENTION-26FEB26","exchange_index":0,"expected_expiration_time":"2026-02-26T15:00:00Z","expiration_time":"2026-02-26T15:00:00Z","expiration_value":"Yes","last_price_dollars":"0.9900","latest_expiration_time":"2026-02-26T15:00:00Z","market_type":"binary","no_ask_dollars":"1.0000","no_bid_dollars":"0.0000","no_sub_title":"Trump","notional_value_dollars":"1.0000","open_interest_fp":"0.00","open_time":"2026-02-25T20:50:00Z","previous_price_dollars":"0.0000","previous_yes_ask_dollars":"0.0000","previous_yes_bid_dollars":"0.0000","price_level_structure":"linear_cent","price_ranges":[{"end":"1.0000","start":"0.0000","step":"0.0100"}],"result":"yes","rules_primary":"If Gretchen Whitmer says Trump as part of 2026 State of the State Address, then the market resolves to Yes.","rules_secondary":"Video of the 2026 State of the State Address will be primarily used to resolve the market; if a consensus by Kalshi employees cannot be reached using video, transcripts of the 2026 State of the Stat